The commented-out parameter name `/*size*/` is inconsistent with the `virtual_free` method above which doesn't comment out the unused parameter name. For consistency, either use `[[maybe_unused]]` attribute or comment out unused parameters consistently across all methods.
```suggestion
  void unmap(void* addr, [[maybe_unused]] size_t size, std::error_code& ec) const override {
    if (!::UnmapViewOfFile(addr)) {
      ec = std::error_code(::GetLastError(), std::system_category());
    }
  }

  void advise([[maybe_unused]] void* addr, [[maybe_unused]] size_t size, [[maybe_unused]] io_advice advice,
              [[maybe_unused]] std::error_code& ec) const override {
