body:
`thread_helper` stores a `std::unique_ptr<impl>` but this header doesn’t include `<memory>`. Please add `#include <memory>` so the header is self-contained and compiles when included from TU’s that haven’t already pulled in `<memory>`.
```suggestion
#include <thread>
#include <memory>
```

