body:
`scoped_background_thread` deletes move operations but still has an implicit copy constructor/assignment. Copying this guard would cause `leave_background()` to run multiple times for a single `enter_background()` (double-end). Please delete the copy ctor/assignment as well (or implement a safe move-only guard).
```suggestion
    }
    scoped_background_thread(const scoped_background_thread&) = delete;
    scoped_background_thread& operator=(const scoped_background_thread&) = delete;
```

